  "description": "*PLEASE SEND ALL ENQURIES VIA DAFT ONLY*\n\nRowan Fitzgerald Auctioneers are delighted to present this exceptionally well-maintained two-bedroom ground floor apartment located in the highly sought-after development of Dooradoyle Park, Dooradoyle, Limerick.\nThis bright and spacious property is presented in excellent condition throughout and comes fully furnished, offering comfortable and modern living in a convenient residential location. Refuse collection and private parking are included in the monthly rent.\n\nThe accommodation comprises:\n•\tWelcoming entrance hallway.\n•\tTwo generous double bedrooms, including a bedroom with ensuite bathroom and walk-in wardrobe.\n•\tLarge main bathroom complete with both a bath and shower.\n•\tSpacious open-plan kitchen, living and dining area with ample natural light.\n•\tSliding doors leading to a large private rear garden, ideal for outdoor dining and relaxation.\n\nFeatures:\n•\tGround floor apartment.\n•\tTwo spacious double bedrooms.\n•\tDouble bedroom with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe.\n•\tLarge private rear garden.\n•\tFully furnished.\n•\tParking included.\n•\tRefuse collection included in the rent.\n•\tSought-after residential location.\n\nClose to University Hospital Limerick, Raheen Business Park, Crescent Shopping Centre, schools, and a range of local amenities. Excellent public transport links and easy access to the M20, M7 and N18 road networks.Dooradoyle Park is one of Limerick's most sought-after residential developments, offering a superb combination of convenience and a peaceful suburban setting. Situated in the heart of Dooradoyle, the property is within walking distance of a wide range of amenities, making it an ideal location. \n\nUniversity Hospital Limerick and Raheen Business Park are just minutes away, The Crescent Shopping Centre is also nearby, offering an excellent selection of shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, and essential services. Residents can enjoy easy access to local parks, gyms, sports clubs, and scenic walking routes, while a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools are located within close proximity. The area is well served by regular public transport, and the nearby M20, M7, and N18 road networks provide excellent connectivity to Limerick City Centre, Shannon, Galway, Cork, and beyond.\n\n*We invite tenant CV's from Homehak for all of our properties* \nDisclaimer:\nThese particulars and terms are provided by Rowan Fitzgerald Auctioneers with the understanding that all negotiations regarding the mentioned property must be conducted exclusively through them. While every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of the information provided, Rowan Fitzgerald Auctioneers makes no warranties, express or implied, regarding the particulars or any representations made about the property. The details in this brochure do not form any part of a contract. Prospective purchasers or lessees are advised to independently verify all details to their satisfaction. Rowan Fitzgerald Auctioneers shall not be held responsible for any loss or expenses incurred in visiting the property, including but not limited to instances where the property is found to be unsuitable, already sold, let, or withdrawn from the market.",
